    "title": "Distinguish knowing information and knowing people",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-knowledge-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Distinguish knowing information and knowing people",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "认识 concerns familiarity with a person. 知道 concerns information. 懂 and 明白 describe understanding a meaning or explanation.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我认识老师，知道他的名字。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ rènshi lǎoshī ， zhīdào tā de míngzi 。",
                "meaning": "I know the teacher and know his name.",
                "audio": "2981befd983961f55b893b29073b554aa7112a6421abaed7d0b723f30ebb32ae"
              },
              {
                "text": "我明白。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ míngbai 。",
                "meaning": "I understand.",
                "audio": "acd7694e2ce672f0ecc01f775c7bd387346313200ed451b9d2cab15bca58365d"
              },
              {
                "text": "我懂你的意思。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ dǒng nǐ de yìsi 。",
                "meaning": "I understand what you mean.",
                "audio": "c11398f5a5d1cf711f07ac9454b989646be6408558c1b1936bd0c2f769238a93"
              }
            ]
          },
